    "scenesThatPass": [
      "EZMALIA: You look happy.\nVIVIAN: I’m losing a whole weekend full of shifts. Forgot about “spring break.”\nEZMALIA: What’s with you and Spring break? Take a vacation like the other kids.\nVIVIAN: I need the money.",
      "VIVIAN: Yeah. Sure.\nJOYCE: I can take off a day or two next week-- maybe we'll go to the Botanical Gardens. Vinnie's been wanting to go.\nJOYCE: To the Botanical Gardens.\nVIVIAN: Shut up, Vince—",
      "VIVIAN: Oh mom, real nice.\nJOYCE: I went to Oneonta—",
      "JOYCE: If I hadn't gotten pregnant—\nVIVIAN: Great mom, so I spoiled your college degree—\nJOYCE: You didn't spoil anything. I only said that if I hadn't had you I woulda--\nJOYCE: Where you goin'?",
      "VIVIAN: Jesus!\nJOYCE: Vinnie, you apologize to me!"
    ]
